1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:08,500
Data Vault 2.0 gives enterprises complete historical
auditability and resilient multi-source integration.

2
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:18,200
Yet asking an LLM to write Data Vault SQL directly risks
hash collisions, leaked surrogate keys, and destructive UPDATEs.

3
00:00:18,200 --> 00:00:27,850
Open-DV pairs Agent-first discovery with the 6-gate axi-dv
verifier before 5-Zone (Z0-Z4) SQL compiles.

4
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:39,500
Launch locally on loopback 127.0.0.1:8420 with opendv serve --open,
zero login friction, and fail-closed --allow-remote-unauthenticated guard.

5
00:00:39,500 --> 00:00:51,500
In Steps 1 to 3 of the Unified 6-Step Wizard, choose a baseline or
6 starter packs, attach SQLite, Databricks UC, PDFs, and inline notes.

6
00:00:51,500 --> 00:01:01,500
Preview up to 50 local rows and LiteParse spans with zero mention
floor, or Fast-Forward to Step 6 when your schema is ready.

7
00:01:02,250 --> 00:01:15,500
Step 4 enforces the 422 AGENT_NOT_CONFIGURED setup gate and live Cost
Meter before single-pass synthesis across 6 harness providers.

8
00:01:15,500 --> 00:01:28,500
Cherry-pick Beyond-FIBO and 1x Semantic rules, inspect citations in
the 716px drawer, and review the Step 5 elkjs diff graph or export YAML/TTL.

9
00:01:28,500 --> 00:01:37,500
Step 6 auto-binds deployed_contract and runs the 7-pill 00-06 console
with inline Steward Hold, Budget Hold, and Drift Sync back to Step 4.

10
00:01:38,250 --> 00:01:51,500
Gates G0 through G5 enforce SQLGlot AST rules, NetworkX bipartite
proofs, and 4 adversarial DuckDB batches with @toon_v1 self-healing.

11
00:01:51,500 --> 00:02:04,850
Switch to the 4-View DV Schema Explorer to inspect Hub-Link-Sat-PIT
topology, 100% Column Triage, W1-W2-W3 diffs, and Safe Read-Only SQL.

12
00:02:05,250 --> 00:02:20,000
Open Logs & Traces in SessionLogsInspector for live W3C EventSource
telemetry, PII-masked prompts, LLM outputs, and 50 MB bundle export.

13
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:31,850
Compile multi-dialect DuckDB and Databricks Delta 5-Zone (Z0-Z4) SQL
spanning bronze, staging, raw_vault, business_vault, and information_mart.

14
00:02:32,250 --> 00:02:44,850
Run the same workflow headlessly with opendv and opendvctl parity
subcommands: run dv-schema, attach-source, fibo-qa, and ontology studio logs.
